------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  PLATEAU DIAGNOSTIC
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Plateau / regression began at step 400
  Component magnitudes around plateau (avg over +-30 steps):
    L_prag = +6.235 (CE-like)
    L_epi  = -4.669 (epistemic)
    L_pol  = +1.775 (policy KL)
    L_cmp  = +0.272 (complexity KL)
  InfoNCE upper-bound on |L_epi| ~ ln(N+1) = ln(33) = 3.497
  >>> L_epi has saturated at the InfoNCE bound -- this is the canonical
      InfoNCE pathology: the critic learns to discriminate trivially, 
      L_epi becomes large negative, and dominates the gradient. Pragmatic 
      learning halts. Mitigation: cap L_epi (e.g. clamp to >=-1.0), or
      reduce lambda_epi (e.g. 0.1) so pragmatic gradient dominates.

